      "pattern": "A，但是 B (but)",
      "explanation_en": "Use 但是 to join two parts of a sentence that contrast. The first part says one thing, and the second part says something that goes against it.",
      "example_zh": "这个手机很好用，但是有点儿重。",
      "example_en": "This phone is easy to use, but it is a bit heavy."
